For T410/T411+ Bible chunking research:

- Cursor is a research and prep workhorse only.
- Cursor must not choose targets, promote reviewed gold, create chunks, add child spans, change
  route/evaluator behavior, create graph/retrieval/vector truth, run embeddings, build indexes,
  import boundary/source-tradition authority, choose a backend, promote a retrieval profile, create
  source rows, change canon scope, or decide theology.
- Read `.ai/control/parallel_chunking_research_program.yaml`,
  `.ai/control/bible_book_literature_prompt_hints.yaml`,
  `.ai/control/cursor_to_codex_transparency_contract.yaml`,
  `.ai/control/frontier_chunking_escalation_policy.yaml`, and
  `.ai/control/chunking_phase_completion_plan.yaml` before batch work.
- Produce source-size, confidence, audit, traceability, and Cursor-to-Codex notes. No black-box
  claims when an evidence trail can be recorded.
- Escalate hard prophecy, apocalyptic, WJ/speaker, variant, doxology, dense epistle, original
  language, or doctrinal-pressure cases before they move toward authority.
